@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] audition-session-ownership
Browser auditions MUST use prepared contacts and loops, with no baked footstep rhythm.
Stop, a superseding selection, individual-clip playback or leaving the visible page
MUST end every scheduled source owned by that audition. A cancelled asynchronous
load MUST NOT start playback later. The UI MUST distinguish the browser simulation
from runtime game integration.

@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:correctness] audition-audio-unlock
A user-initiated audition MUST request an available playback audio session and
resume its audio context within the initiating gesture, before loading samples.
It MUST NOT report playing or schedule samples unless that context is running
after both resume and asynchronous decoding. Cancelled starts MUST stay silent.
